<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 6 Conclusion &amp; Discussion ‣ EValueSteer:Measuring Reward Model Steerability Towards Values and Preferences" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">RMs fall short on value-and style-aligned steering.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 6 Conclusion &amp; Discussion ‣ EValueSteer:Measuring Reward Model Steerability Towards Values and Preferences" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">RMs exhibit implicit bias preferences to <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">secular and self-expression values</span>.</span></a></li>
